{
  "$comment": "MOTERVA B-led design system — semantic tokens (docs/03 artifact, ADR 0004). Dark is the flagship presentation; light shares components, information architecture, behavior and financial semantics. Every color value is traceable to the merged design lab (apps/web/src/design-lab) unless marked origin:new. Contrast requirements at the bottom are machine-verified by scripts/check-design-tokens.mjs (WCAG 2.x relative luminance; AA 4.5:1 text, 3:1 UI components).",
